# Dark field, accent pop

Vibrant color pops **because** the field is black/charcoal and quiet — not because boxes are filled with purple.

## Recipe (DE tokens only)

| Role | Token | Use |
|------|--------|-----|
| Deep well | `--de-bg` `#050312` | Chapter field |
| Marketing field | `--de-surface` `#0a0a0a` | Adjacent dark chapter |
| Raised box | `--de-raised` `#151217` + `--de-hairline` | Panels, cards, chips |
| Pop | `#D3126A` | CTA fill, active border, colon, icon |

Violet `#5B45E0` / `#8B5CF6` = lighting only. Never a wash fill.

## Do

- Black/charcoal field → charcoal raised box → white type → magenta punctuation
- Hairline chips: transparent/`bg-de-raised`, `border-de-hairline`; active = `border-[#D3126A]`
- Magenta colon after a statement heading (Trust / Engage pattern)
- Paper chapters: white lift + magenta accent, not violet-100 fills

## Do not

- Purple/navy/indigo fills on cards, chips, buttons, or section backgrounds
- `bg-violet-500/15`, `from-purple-600 to-indigo-600`, `#FF00FF`, rainbow
- Glass `bg-white/5 backdrop-blur` as the card recipe
- Giant neon blooms or cyberpunk glow
- Copy OpenMSP/OpenFrame logos, copy, APPROVE/REJECT, or fake “Featured in”

```tsx
// ❌ muddy chrome
<div className="rounded-2xl bg-violet-500/15 backdrop-blur-xl">
  <span className="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-600">CTA</span>
</div>

// ✅ quiet field, accent pops
<div className="rounded-2xl border border-de-hairline bg-de-raised">
  <span className="bg-[#D3126A] text-white">Get My Cyber Risk Assessment</span>
</div>
```
